    "body": "> Hey [@jhedfors](https://github.com/jhedfors) It should already be possible to add multiple docker integrations. See https://homarr.dev/docs/next/advanced/environment-variables/#docker\n\nThank you. I have not been able to get it configured correctly. I am unable to see the other environments\n```\n      - DOCKER_HOSTNAMES:npm,arr,homeassistant,portianer\n      - DOCKER_PORTS:9001,7575,81,443,446,82,9443,8000,9000,3000,3001,80\n\n```\nIdeally, this would be something one could update in the GUI.",
