    "created_at": "2026-04-19T19:44:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-04-19T19:46:13Z",
    "body": "Hello,\n\nPlease can you give a bit more information on how to add an additional host?\n\nMy Homarr works fine for Docker containers on the same system as Homarr.\n\nAfter reading the above on adding hosts, I have now tried adding 1 of my extra docker hosts (192.168.0.15) along with the local machine. This is how it now appears in my portainer:\n\n<img width=\"839\" height=\"80\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a8906df3-3ae2-4df0-85f4-74a2113a9d68\"\n />\nNow when I restart the Homarr container and reload the web page I can't find where or how to set up the additional host. If I try to add a **New item** to one of my boards and then choose **Docker Stats** from the options, it simply adds another widget which points to the local Docker instance and I can't find any way to specify the new additional host.\n\nCan someone help please?\n\nMany thanks",
